#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Angry Ex-Employee"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Akiyama"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr "Viejo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "92_Angry Ex-Employee"
msgid "Enough of this bullshit. I worked with his dad for more than thirty years."
msgstr "Estoy harto de esta mierda. Trabajé con su padre más de treinta años."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Angry Ex-Employee"
msgid "We were good friends, all of us. And then this... this\\r\nignorant moron... He tore it all to pieces."
msgstr "Éramos como una familia. Y luego este... este\\r\nmaldito hijo idiota tenía que arruinarlo todo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_60_80_MOUNTAIN_VF_OFF"
msgid "That company... That company was...\\r\n*sob*"
msgstr "Esa empresa... era todo lo que...\\r\n*sollozo*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Shiobara"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "140_Akiyama"
msgid "It can't be easy to start over at your age. But if you're\\r\nwilling to try, stop by Sky Finance on Tenkaichi Street."
msgstr "No debe ser fácil empezar de nuevo a tu edad. Pero si\\r\nde verdad quieres intentarlo, pásate por Sky Finance en\\r\nla calle Tenkaichi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Angry Ex-Employee"
msgid "I'm just a moneylender, but a little money might be just\\r\nwhat you need right now."
msgstr "Solo soy un prestamista, pero a lo mejor un empujoncito\\r\neconómico es lo que necesitas ahora mismo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Angry Ex-Employee"
msgid "Sky Finance...?"
msgstr "¿Sky Finance...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Akiyama"
msgid "Drop by any time."
msgstr "Te estaré esperando."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Shiobara"
msgid "You knew all along. You knew that downsizing was the only way to get that company in the black."
msgstr "Lo sabías desde el principio... Sabías que reducir personal era la única manera de salvar esa empresa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Akiyama"
msgid "Yep. Sure did."
msgstr "En efecto. Lo sabía."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Shiobara"
msgid "I knew it! Then, why? Why!?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿por qué? ¡¿Por qué hiciste esto?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Shiobara"
msgid "His friends had been with him from the start. The president\\r\ndidn't want to downsize, but that was the only way to save\\r\nhis company."
msgstr "El presidente dice que no quiere echar a la gente que lo apoyó\\r\ndesde el inicio, pero tiene que hacerlo para que la\\r\nempresa sea rentable."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "And he still couldn't bring himself to do it, so you've come\\r\nhere to mull it all over, is that right?"
msgstr "No pudiste decírselo, ¿verdad?\\r\nEs por eso que estabas aquí dándole vueltas al asunto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Shiobara"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Akiyama"
msgid "That angry old man, Paradise Advertising... I imagine you\\r\nprobably understand this now, but downsizing isn't\\r\nnecessarily a bad thing."
msgstr "Con lo de tu padre y lo de Publicidad Paradise,\\r\nsupongo que ya te diste cuenta.\\r\nReducir personal no siempre significa algo malo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Talk_No"
msgid "Sure, it's not always the ideal or even the only option, but\\r\nsometimes you have to do what's best for the company."
msgstr "Claro, no siempre es la opción ideal, pero a veces hay que\\r\ntomar decisiones difíciles por el bien de la empresa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Angry Ex-Employee"
msgid "If you don't, you might end up hurting a lot more people,\\r\nlike that old man."
msgstr "De lo contrario, podrías terminar lastimando a mucha más\\r\ngente, como a ese anciano."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Shiobara"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Akiyama"
msgid "Do you see what I'm trying to say?"
msgstr "¿Entiendes lo que intento decir?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Shiobara"
msgid "Akiyama-san... Could you ask that leaflet company guy to\\r\ncome meet us here?"
msgstr "Akiyama-san... ¿Sería tan amable de contactar al director\\r\nde la empresa de folletos y pedirle que venga?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure. I'll call him right now."
msgstr "Claro. Lo llamaré ahora mismo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Akiyama"
msgid "Yes, hello? This is Akiyama from Sky Finance. We have\\r\nsomething we'd like to talk to you about... Could you come\\r\nmeet us at the park?"
msgstr "¿Presidente? Habla Akiyama de Sky Finance.\\r\nTenemos algo que nos gustaría discutir con usted...\\r\n¿Podría venir al parque?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "What is it, Akiyama-san? Is something wrong?"
msgstr "¿Qué sucede, Akiyama-san? ¿Pasó algo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Akiyama"
msgid "Shiobara-kun wants to talk to you."
msgstr "Shiobara-kun quiere hablar contigo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Shiobara"
msgid "Uh, well... I once brought down my father's printing company\\r\nbecause I didn't want to downsize and lose all of the good\\r\npeople he'd employed over the years..."
msgstr "Verá... cometí un error en el pasado. Me negaba a despedir a\\r\nla buena gente que trabajó durante años en la empresa de\\r\nmi padre, y terminé llevándola a la quiebra..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "632_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "Yes... I thought as much. But my people have been with me\\r\nsince the beginning. How could I just force them out like\\r\nthat?"
msgstr "Sí... Lo entiendo... Pero son como mi familia...\\r\n¿Cómo se supone que los eche a la calle así sin más?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "644_Shiobara"
msgid "If the business fails, that's it! Everything's over! All of\\r\nyour employees get hurt－every last one of them!"
msgstr "¡Si la empresa quiebra, se acabó! ¡¡Todos tus empleados\\r\nsaldrán perdiendo, ninguno se salvará!!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "656_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "668_Shiobara"
msgid "I understand it's a tough decision to make, but it's the\\r\npresident's responsibility to protect the company..."
msgstr "Por eso, aunque sea un decisión difícil, el presidente\\r\ndebe hacerlo... Tiene que velar por la supervivencia\nde su empresa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "680_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "Akiyama-san?"
msgstr "¿Akiyama-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "692_Akiyama"
msgid "I agree. Downsizing's the only option. My heart goes out to\\r\nyou, but it's got to be better than turning everybody out\\r\ninto the streets."
msgstr "Concuerdo. Reducir personal es la única opción. Siento\\r\nmucho lo que estás pasando, pero es mejor que dejar\\r\na todo el mundo en la calle."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "704_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "I see. I guess that really is the only way to go, then..."
msgstr "Ya veo. No queda otra opción, por mucho que me duela..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "716_Shiobara"
msgid "I just have one favor to ask of you."
msgstr "Sólo tengo un favor que pedirle."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "728_Angry Ex-Employee"
msgid "If this downsizing does turn your company around, make sure\\r\nthe people who were forced out get first crack at working\\r\nfor you again."
msgstr "Si esta reducción de personal logra salvar su empresa, no\\r\nolvide a aquellos que se tuvieron que ir. Deles prioridad\\r\npara volver a trabajar con usted."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "740_Talk_No"
msgid "After all, it's those employees who served the company by\\r\nleaving, and they'd all been friends and coworkers for a\\r\nlong time..."
msgstr "Incluso si terminaron siendo despedidos,\\r\nellos incluso contribuyeron a la empresa con su renuncia.\\r\nRecuerde que son amigos, como su familia..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "752_Paradise Advertising President"
msgid "All right. I promise I will."
msgstr "Está bien. Te prometo que lo haré."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "764_Talk_No"
msgid "When I first met you, Shiobara-san, I'd assumed you were\\r\nnothing more than some half-baked smartass. But now I see\\r\nthat you look out for everyone like a fine, upstanding CEO."
msgstr "Shiobara-san, cuando te conocí, pensé que eras un tipo\\r\narrogante y charlatán. Pero ahora veo que eres un\\r\ndirector ejemplar, que cuida de su gente y su sustento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "776_Talk_Ojigi"
msgid "I know it's awfully hard, but we've got to do the best we\\r\ncan by our employees. Now, if you'll excuse me..."
msgstr "Es una decisión dura, pero debemos velar por el bienestar\\r\nde nuestros trabajadores. Ahora, si me disculpan..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "788_Shiobara"
msgid "Thank you very much. I've learned a lot from all of this..."
msgstr "M-muchas gracias. He aprendido mucho de todo esto..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "800_Akiyama"
msgid "Paradise Advertising will be in the black soon enough, so\\r\nlet's consider the test passed. The money is yours, provided\\r\nyou're still interested?"
msgstr "Veo un futuro brillante para Publicidad Paradise, así que\\r\nconsidero esta prueba superada. ¿Sigues queriendo\\r\nel préstamo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "812_Shiobara"
msgid "Yes, I am. I can't give up now."
msgstr "Sí, lo quiero. No puedo rendirme ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "824_Talk_Yes"
msgid "I still don't know what kind of company to build, but I'm\\r\ngoing to do my best to make sure it brings happiness to\\r\neveryone who works there. I can promise you that much!"
msgstr "Todavía no tengo claro qué tipo de empresa crear, pero\\r\nme aseguraré de que la gente que trabaje allí sea lo más\\r\nfeliz posible. ¡Esa es mi promesa!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "836_Akiyama"
msgid "And for right now, that's enough. Here you are, then. Five\\r\nmillion yen."
msgstr "Eso es más que suficiente por ahora.\\r\nToma, aquí tienes los cinco millones."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "848_Shiobara"
msgid "Thank you so much! I'm going to give it everything I've got!"
msgstr "¡Muchísimas gracias! ¡Me esforzaré al máximo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "860_Akiyama"
msgid "Um... This is all I've got, but I'd like you to at least have\\r\nsome token of my gratitude. Please accept it along with my\\r\nthanks!"
msgstr "Sé que no es mucho, pero quiero expresarle mi más\\r\nprofundo agradecimiento. ¡Por favor, acepte este pequeño\\r\nobsequio!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "896_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure, why not? Thank you kindly."
msgstr "Claro, ¿por qué no? Muchas gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "908_Shiobara"
msgid "All right, I'm off! I'm about to become a very busy man!"
msgstr "¡Bueno, me voy! ¡Voy a estar muy ocupado a partir de ahora!"

